Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,420] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 18 | Text: 今天我们来讲人生回报率最高的13项自我投资
Segment #2   [00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:05,440] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 第一条现在就开始学存钱
Segment #3   [00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,240] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 9  | Text: 哪怕每个月只存500块
Segment #4   [00:00:07,240 --> 00:00:09,560] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 12 | Text: 也得先把这个好习惯赚在手里
Segment #5   [00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,080] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 等过个半年一年
Segment #6   [00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:13,020] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 12 | Text: 你心里那种十打十的安稳感
Segment #7   [00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,880] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 11 | Text: 是你从前从来没摸到过的
Segment #8   [00:00:14,880 --> 00:00:16,040] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 4  | Text: 这就是安全感
Segment #9   [00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:18,200] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 11 | Text: 存款就是你抬头走路的底气
Segment #10  [00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,480] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 往后的日子里
Segment #11  [00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:21,040] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 9  | Text: 它总能给你称出厂子
Segment #12  [00:00:21,040 --> 00:00:22,840] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 9  | Text: 第二条就是投资自己的形象
Segment #13  [00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:24,560] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 10 | Text: 去设计一个适合自己的发型
Segment #14  [00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:26,260] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 9  | Text: 选择几套得体的衣服
Segment #15  [00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:28,200] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 9  | Text: 但是千万不要去买奢侈品
Segment #16  [00:00:28,200 --> 00:00:29,540] | Elapsed:  15.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 只要干净得体就好
Segment #17  [00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:30,840] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 过段时间你就能发现
Segment #18  [00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:33,020] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 13 | Text: 身边人对你的态度肉眼可见变了
Segment #19  [00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:33,860] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 2  | Text: 第三条
Segment #20  [00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,740] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 13 | Text: 找一项能让你静下心来的运动
Segment #21  [00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:37,340] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 8  | Text: 跑步 瑜伽 拢铁都行
Segment #22  [00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,340] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 4  | Text: 只要练的时候
Segment #23  [00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:40,120] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 12 | Text: 能让你忘了杂事进入状态就可以
Segment #24  [00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,440] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 5  | Text: 每周练三次
Segment #25  [00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:42,660] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 7  | Text: 每次花一小时左右
Segment #26  [00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:44,520] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 运动的时候脑子特别清爽
Segment #27  [00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:46,400] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 10 | Text: 平常工作生活里绕不出来的坎
Segment #28  [00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,100] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 11 | Text: 跑完练完你一下子就想通了
Segment #29  [00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:48,860] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 2  | Text: 第四
Segment #30  [00:00:48,860 --> 00:00:51,180] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 11 | Text: 隔段时间就清理一下你的朋友圈子
Segment #31  [00:00:51,180 --> 00:00:52,960] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 一定要躲开那些天天抱怨
Segment #32  [00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:54,180] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 6  | Text: 只会拖垮你的人
Segment #33  [00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,680] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 主动往优秀的人身边靠
Segment #34  [00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,800] | Elapsed:  34.69s | Words: 9  | Text: 这就是大家说的社交传染
Segment #35  [00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,260] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 7  | Text: 你整个人的状态
Segment #36  [00:00:59,260 --> 00:01:01,060] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 11 | Text: 绝对会被身边的人影响带走
Segment #37  [00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:01,960] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 3  | Text: 第五条
Segment #38  [00:01:01,960 --> 00:01:03,380] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 8  | Text: 每天早起来一小时
Segment #39  [00:01:03,380 --> 00:01:04,900] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 8  | Text: 做只属于你自己的事
Segment #40  [00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:06,740] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 11 | Text: 不是让你早起摸手机刷视频
Segment #41  [00:01:06,740 --> 00:01:08,520] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 8  | Text: 得用这时间看书学习
Segment #42  [00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:09,140] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 4  | Text: 或者动一动
Segment #43  [00:01:09,140 --> 00:01:11,540] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 12 | Text: 因为做这些能让你变得更好的事
Segment #44  [00:01:11,540 --> 00:01:13,840] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 13 | Text: 走着走着就把你的人生轨迹改了
Segment #45  [00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:14,820] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 3  | Text: 第六条
Segment #46  [00:01:14,820 --> 00:01:16,660] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 11 | Text: 每年至少读十到二十本书
Segment #47  [00:01:16,660 --> 00:01:18,080] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 9  | Text: 挑能帮你找认知的读
Segment #48  [00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,900] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 10 | Text: 别抱着网络爽而不肯放
Segment #49  [00:01:19,900 --> 00:01:21,560] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 11 | Text: 要找那种能帮你换个思路
Segment #50  [00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:22,480] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 5  | Text: 想事情的书读
Segment #51  [00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:23,400] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 3  | Text: 第七条
Segment #52  [00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:25,000] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 每年抽时间去一个
Segment #53  [00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,080] | Elapsed:  53.87s | Words: 7  | Text: 你从没去过的地方
Segment #54  [00:01:26,080 --> 00:01:27,440] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 在那待个两三天
Segment #55  [00:01:27,440 --> 00:01:28,940] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 8  | Text: 不用赶紧点拍打卡照
Segment #56  [00:01:28,940 --> 00:01:30,600] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 要慢慢融进当地人的日子
Segment #57  [00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,520] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 13 | Text: 真正切切感受当地的风土人情
Segment #58  [00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:34,640] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 13 | Text: 这样才能冲开你固有的认知框框
Segment #59  [00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:35,380] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 让你看见人生
Segment #60  [00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:36,700] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 9  | Text: 还有好多不一样的活法
Segment #61  [00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:37,520] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 3  | Text: 第八条
Segment #62  [00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:39,200] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 9  | Text: 学点投资理财的本事
Segment #63  [00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:41,260] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 12 | Text: 不是让你一头扎进股市下潮股
Segment #64  [00:01:41,260 --> 00:01:43,560] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 12 | Text: 是先搞懂最基础的财商知识
Segment #65  [00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:45,520] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 弄明白钱到底是怎么赚起来的
Segment #66  [00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,580] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 3  | Text: 第九条
Segment #67  [00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:48,640] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 一定要用硬态度守住你的睡眠
Segment #68  [00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:51,060] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 14 | Text: 熬夜就是在投资你以后的情绪稳定
Segment #69  [00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:52,000] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 和身体免疫力
Segment #70  [00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,680] | Elapsed:  73.14s | Words: 9  | Text: 必须把睡过七八小时
Segment #71  [00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:55,700] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 13 | Text: 当成一件不能讨价还价的事来做
Segment #72  [00:01:55,700 --> 00:01:56,620] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 3  | Text: 第十条
Segment #73  [00:01:56,620 --> 00:01:58,300] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 9  | Text: 一定要练出反脆弱的心态
Segment #74  [00:01:58,300 --> 00:02:00,720] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 13 | Text: 玻璃心事年轻时候最没用的东西
Segment #75  [00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:01,740] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 7  | Text: 碰到不顺心的事
Segment #76  [00:02:01,740 --> 00:02:03,720] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 别总念到为什么偏偏是我
Segment #77  [00:02:03,720 --> 00:02:04,560] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 5  | Text: 不如问问自己
Segment #78  [00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,880] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 7  | Text: 我能从这里学到什么
Segment #79  [00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:06,940] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 第十一条
Segment #80  [00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:08,060] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 7  | Text: 练出独处的本事
Segment #81  [00:02:08,060 --> 00:02:09,280] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 怕一个人待着的人
Segment #82  [00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:11,000] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 11 | Text: 往往挤在人群里就丢了自己
Segment #83  [00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,280] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 咱们要学会独处的时候
Segment #84  [00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:13,080] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 5  | Text: 给自己冲冲练
Segment #85  [00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:15,500] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 11 | Text: 把注意力从别人会不会觉得我不好
Segment #86  [00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:17,100] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 10 | Text: 转回到我今天开不开心上
Segment #87  [00:02:17,100 --> 00:02:18,340] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 第十二条
Segment #88  [00:02:18,700 --> 00:02:20,300] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 9  | Text: 养成每天复盘的习惯
Segment #89  [00:02:20,300 --> 00:02:22,340] | Elapsed:  92.63s | Words: 10 | Text: 每天睡前花十分钟履履
Segment #90  [00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,300] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 11 | Text: 这半个漂亮的一件事搞砸了
Segment #91  [00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:26,880] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 9  | Text: 记下来下次怎么躲开这个坑
Segment #92  [00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:28,260] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 4  | Text: 第十三条
Segment #93  [00:02:28,260 --> 00:02:29,400] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 学会放过自己
Segment #94  [00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,180] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 这一条最重要也最难做到
Segment #95  [00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:32,560] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 9  | Text: 要接受自己偶尔会偷懒
Segment #96  [00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:33,980] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 8  | Text: 接受有些事就是做不好
Segment #97  [00:02:33,980 --> 00:02:35,400] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 有些人就是留不住
Segment #98  [00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,380] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 11 | Text: 别人给自己套一个完美的架子
Segment #99  [00:02:37,380 --> 00:02:39,180] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 11 | Text: 该放松的时候就停下来穿口气
Segment #100 [00:02:39,180 --> 00:02:41,100] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 12 | Text: 其实咱们的人生是一场长线游戏
Segment #101 [00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,740] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 12 | Text: 做自我投资就是赚时间给你的福利
Segment #102 [00:02:44,140 --> 00:02:45,440] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果你现在还想改变
Segment #103 [00:02:45,440 --> 00:02:47,280] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 10 | Text: 还想把自己的时间重新理清楚
Segment #104 [00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,420] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 4  | Text: 那就从今天开始
Segment #105 [00:02:48,420 --> 00:02:49,660] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 把每一分钱
Segment #106 [00:02:49,660 --> 00:02:50,280] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 4  | Text: 每一分钟
Segment #107 [00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,080] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 5  | Text: 每一分力气
Segment #108 [00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:52,260] | Elapsed: 111.14s | Words: 7  | Text: 都花在未来的你
Segment #109 [00:02:52,260 --> 00:02:53,580] | Elapsed: 118.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 会感谢现在你的事上
Segment #110 [00:02:53,580 --> 00:02:55,840] | Elapsed: 118.55s | Words: 12 | Text: 你永远是自己人生里最大的股东
Segment #111 [00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,040] | Elapsed: 118.55s | Words: 4  | Text: 加油陌生人
Segment #112 [00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:58,060] | Elapsed: 118.55s | Words: 6  | Text: 祝你们越来越好
